WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.600
Here is the rule that connects them.

2
00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.400
In an emergency, the agency in charge leads.

3
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:17.400
If a Civil Defense or police officer gives you an instruction to keep people safe, do it straight away

4
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.800
- and then tell your supervisor what you have been asked to do.

5
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:33.400
That way your chain always knows where you are, what you are doing and if you need any additional support.

